# Later

Ideas, suggestions, and questions that are **not** in scope. This file exists so that a good
idea has somewhere to go other than into the project.

Everything the coding agent suggests that the author did not ask for lands here by default —
including every "what should you be asking" question from a closeout. Nothing moves from here
into scope unless the author asks for it in their own words, and when it does, it becomes a
decision in `governance/decisions.yaml`.

Format: one line per item, newest at the top, with the date and where it came from.

